[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7262.79, "timestamp": "02:01:02", "text": "そして彼らはその男にお金を返金し、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7265.189, "timestamp": "02:01:05", "text": "それから彼はTwitterに投稿したか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7266.79, "timestamp": "02:01:06", "text": "War Thunderで叫んでいるようなもの、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7268.87, "timestamp": "02:01:08", "text": "「お前ら一体どうしちまったんだ？」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7276.629, "timestamp": "02:01:16", "text": "彼がそれを清算したので、2万ドルです。今彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7278.79, "timestamp": "02:01:18", "text": "実際には2万ドルを持っている。彼は支払わなければならない"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7279.613, "timestamp": "02:01:19", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7279.709, "timestamp": "02:01:19", "text": "税金"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7282.83, "timestamp": "02:01:22", "text": "「ああ、なんてことだ。」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7285.51, "timestamp": "02:01:25", "text": "神。彼が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7287.189, "timestamp": "02:01:27", "text": "どちらの場合も、彼は税金を支払う必要はないだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7288.669, "timestamp": "02:01:28", "text": "それに対して。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7291.109, "timestamp": "02:01:31", "text": "うん。なぜ彼らは彼らに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7293.83, "timestamp": "02:01:33", "text": "ゲーム内アイテム？それはゲーム内のアイテムです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7296.31, "timestamp": "02:01:36", "text": "なぜなら彼らは決してそのアイテムをそれらのアイテム"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7298.149, "timestamp": "02:01:38", "text": "存在しなかった。それはエイプリルフールの冗談だった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7301.35, "timestamp": "02:01:41", "text": "ジョーク。ああ、まるで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7305.43, "timestamp": "02:01:45", "text": "特別なゴールデンドージカードを手に入れよう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7306.109, "timestamp": "02:01:46", "text": "の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7310.03, "timestamp": "02:01:50", "text": "ドージ犬の絵文字や、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7312.709, "timestamp": "02:01:52", "text": "それ。ゴールデンパスがもらえます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7314.95, "timestamp": "02:01:54", "text": "そういうこと。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7318.39, "timestamp": "02:01:58", "text": "A それは壮大なミームパッケージのようなものだった、"}]